# The directive lands, and nothing tells the idle lead it is there.
dispatcher: dispatcher pane\n`crew reply worker:<branch> "<directive>"` {
  shape: rectangle
}
reply: crew/internal/reply.Run\nresolves the newest session, appends {
  shape: rectangle
}
bus: crew bus log\nevents.jsonl {
  shape: storage
}
lead: idle claude/pi lead pane\nnothing on screen to read {
  shape: rectangle
}
hand: background `crew nudge <lead> --wait`\nstarted by hand {
  shape: rectangle
  style.stroke: "#C62828"
}
wait: crew/internal/nudge arm.wait()\none lock per lead, types the inbox line {
  shape: rectangle
}
watch: crew stall-watch\n`unread:` auto-nudge after 10 min {
  shape: rectangle
  style.stroke: "#C62828"
}
gap: skipped step:\nnobody starts the wait {
  shape: text
  style.stroke: "#C62828"
}

dispatcher -> reply: posts the directive
reply -> bus: bus.Append(msg)
bus -> lead: unread msg, no wake
hand -> wait: only when the dispatcher remembered
wait -> lead: types `crew inbox "$CREW_WORKER_ID"`
bus -> watch: still unread at 10 min
watch -> lead: late nudge, often after the answer was due
hand -> gap: the step is optional
